# Kubernetes Deployments -- 8 Hands-On Labs

This document records the practical exercises performed with an Nginx
Deployment.

## Lab Environment

Application:

``` text
nginx
```

Deployment:

``` text
nginx-deployment
```

Main YAML file:

``` text
deployment.yaml
```

Basic Deployment:

``` yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: nginx-deployment
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: nginx
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: nginx
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: nginx
          image: nginx:1.26
          ports:
            - containerPort: 80
```

